		(uuid "65c08448-71e7-45e4-bd70-48b19cbb66c6")
	)
	(text "U201/U202 UCC27211DRM (VSON-8): 120 V half-bridge driver with internal bootstrap diode. HI/LI are TTL inputs driven by STM32G474 HRTIM; dead time is set in HRTIM."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 158.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "811f96f6-3780-4349-bdd4-894c3a9224d1")
	)
	(text "Bootstrap 220 nF (design example: 40 nC / 0.5 V -> 80 nF minimum). Above TI's typical 22-100 nF on purpose: a 100 nF X7R drops to about 80 nF under 12 V DC bias. VDD 2.2 uF + 100 nF, about 10x Cboot."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 162.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
